{'symbol': 'EQT', 'date': '2021-11-30 14:12:00', 'title': 'EQT LAUNCHES NEW GIVING PROGRAMS FOR GREENE AND WETZEL COUNTIES', 'text': 'PITTSBURGH, NOV. 30, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0IN HONOR OF GIVING TUESDAY, EQT CORPORATION (NYSE: EQT), IN PARTNERSHIP WITH THE COMMUNITY FOUNDATION OF GREENE COUNTY AND THE COMMUNITY FOUNDATION FOR THE OHIO VALLEY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF TWO NEW GIVING PROGRAMS TO SUPPORT THE COMMUNITIES OF GREENE AND WETZEL COUNTIES. EQT FOUNDATION WILL LAUNCH GIVE GREENE AND GIVE WETZEL WITH AN INITIAL $25,000 DONATION TO EACH FUND.'}